@startuml
' Pass-through case: a <stdlib> include cannot be resolved locally, so every preprocessor
' leaves it untouched and lets the Kroki server resolve it (Kroki bundles the PlantUML
' stdlib, incl. C4-PlantUML). Remote http(s) includes are passed through the same way.
!include <C4/C4_Context>

Person(user, "User")
System(demo, "Antora Kroki demo")
Rel(user, demo, "previews diagrams")
@enduml
